      "content": "i get what u mean about the costs but i really dont want to go to the hospital if i dont have to. if i just take some extra ibuprofen and try to drink a ton of water to flush the stone out like i did last time, would that be okay? the pulsing is still there but i think i can just sleep it off if i take something for the pain. whats the best way to just manage this at home for now so i dont have to deal with the ER?",
